            {
              "id": "offer_blood",
              "text": "Open a palm over the groove.",
              "onPass": {
                "narration": "The stone drinks, and the pain is worse than the cut. But when your vision clears, the altar bowl brims with dense waybread that was not there before, and something old walks with you now.",
